{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lights, Camera, Paradise!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paradise Lust 3 returns to our roots. A full year has passed since the shipwreck that changed your life, and it's once again time for the annual Miss World Media Pageant. But you're no longer just a bartender. Can you rise to the occasion as the competition heats up and everything is put on the line?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616780/extras/e5788f7d85a1e8232473c922ceb5b3ac.poster.avif?t=1773655822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616780/extras/e5788f7d85a1e8232473c922ceb5b3ac.webm?t=1773655822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Getting The Crown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island\u2019s getting dressed up for the pageant\u2019s return, this time with more cameras, bigger sponsors, and a few new challenges. Some familiar pretty faces are back alongside new girls vying for the crown of Miss World Media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616780/extras/7f8268ac243a596f26fbf2ba7899529f.poster.avif?t=1773655822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616780/extras/7f8268ac243a596f26fbf2ba7899529f.webm?t=1773655822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Love in the Limelight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls aren\u2019t just here to compete. Deepen relationships, spark new ones, and if you play your cards right, things get sexual. All new fully animated scenes with returning favorites and new girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616780/extras/39f454bf0d2ff0c755385e693c7ff83f.poster.avif?t=1773655822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616780/extras/39f454bf0d2ff0c755385e693c7ff83f.webm?t=1773655822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Stage is Set</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pageant has gone fully digital. Livestreams, clickbait, and challenges are all designed to make everything go viral. The girls are under pressure and on camera for everyone to watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616780/extras/513ae638519d165e0d46a41c0923f21d.poster.avif?t=1773655822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616780/extras/513ae638519d165e0d46a41c0923f21d.webm?t=1773655822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Work. More Minigames.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More minigames have been added to the mix. You'll juggle stage setups, fix busted gear, wrangle contestants, and somehow still run the bar. New minigames cover everything from pageant prep to keeping the resort running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616780/extras/01c7572458d73c609cc0b51958459eb4.poster.avif?t=1773655822\" width=1170 height=658 ><sour